src/stc/_fixture/massive_es_sample/ under the same CC BY 4.0 terms; it is
selected and reformatted by this project, as stated in its NOTICE.md.

The exact dataset revision, checksum and lineage are documented in
docs/DATA.md. The model card for released weights states the modifications
made by this project.

Released model artifacts
  stc-es-intent-0.1.0.zip ships the fp32 ONNX graph, tokenizer, labels,
  calibration, the TF-IDF baseline and MODEL_CARD.md. The LoRA adapter is
  distributed separately as stc-es-intent-0.1.0-adapter.zip. Both are Apache-2.0
  derivatives of BSC-LT/MrBERT-es; the dataset attribution above travels with
  them. The model registry pins the release sha256.
